#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Latar belakang {#background}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates how to use a Multi-Product Formula (MPF) to achieve a lower Trotter error on our observable compared to the one incurred by the deepest Trotter circuit that we will actually execute.\n"
"MPFs reduce the Trotter error of Hamiltonian dynamics through a weighted combination of several circuit executions. Consider the task of finding observable expectation values for the quantum state\n"
"$\\rho(t)=e^{-i H t} \\rho(0) e^{i H t}$ with the Hamiltonian $H$. One can use Product Formulas (PFs) to approximate the time-evolution $e^{-i H t}$ by doing the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan Formula Berbilang Produk (MPF) untuk mencapai ralat Trotter yang lebih rendah pada observable kita berbanding ralat yang ditanggung oleh Circuit Trotter terdalam yang akan kita jalankan sebenarnya.\n"
"MPF mengurangkan ralat Trotter bagi dinamik Hamiltonian melalui gabungan berwajaran bagi beberapa pelaksanaan Circuit. Pertimbangkan tugas mencari nilai jangkaan observable untuk keadaan kuantum\n"
"$\\rho(t)=e^{-i H t} \\rho(0) e^{i H t}$ dengan Hamiltonian $H$. Kita boleh menggunakan Formula Produk (PF) untuk menghampiri evolusi masa $e^{-i H t}$ dengan cara berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Write the Hamiltonian $H$ as $H=\\sum_{a=1}^d F_a,$ where $F_a$ are "
"Hermitian operators such that each corresponding unitary can be efficiently "
"implemented on a quantum device.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tulis Hamiltonian $H$ sebagai $H=\\sum_{a=1}^d F_a,$ di mana $F_a$ ialah "
"pengoperasi Hermitian supaya setiap unitary yang sepadan boleh dilaksanakan "
"dengan cekap pada peranti kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Approximate the terms $F_a$ that do not commute with each other.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hampirkan sebutan $F_a$ yang tidak bertukar ganti antara satu sama lain.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Then, the first-order PF (Lie-Trotter formula) is:\n"
msgstr "Kemudian, PF peringkat pertama (formula Lie-Trotter) ialah:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$S_1(t):=\\prod_{a=1}^d e^{-i F_a t},$$\n"
msgstr "$$S_1(t):=\\prod_{a=1}^d e^{-i F_a t},$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"which has a quadratic error term $S_1(t)=e^{-i H "
"t}+\\mathcal{O}\\left(t^{2}\\right)$. One can also use higher-order PFs "
"(Lie-Trotter-Suzuki formulas), which converge faster, and are defined "
"recursively as:\n"
msgstr ""
"yang mempunyai sebutan ralat kuadratik $S_1(t)=e^{-i H "
"t}+\\mathcal{O}\\left(t^{2}\\right)$. Kita juga boleh menggunakan PF "
"peringkat lebih tinggi (formula Lie-Trotter-Suzuki), yang menumpu lebih "
"pantas, dan ditakrifkan secara rekursif sebagai:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$S_2(t):=\\prod_{a=1}^d e^{-i F_a t/2}\\prod_{a=1}^d e^{-i F_a t/2}$$\n"
msgstr "$$S_2(t):=\\prod_{a=1}^d e^{-i F_a t/2}\\prod_{a=1}^d e^{-i F_a t/2}$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$S_{2 \\chi}(t):= S_{2 \\chi -2}(s_{\\chi}t)^2 S_{2 \\chi "
"-2}((1-4s_{\\chi})t)S_{2 \\chi -2}(s_{\\chi}t)^2,$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$S_{2 \\chi}(t):= S_{2 \\chi -2}(s_{\\chi}t)^2 S_{2 \\chi "
"-2}((1-4s_{\\chi})t)S_{2 \\chi -2}(s_{\\chi}t)^2,$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $\\chi$ is the order of the symmetric PF and $s_p = \\left( 4 - "
"4^{1/(2p-1)} \\right)^{-1}$. For long time-evolutions, one can split the "
"time interval $t$ into $k$ intervals, called Trotter steps, of duration "
"$t/k$ and approximate the time-evolution in each interval with a $\\chi$ "
"order product formula $S_{\\chi}$. Thus, the PF of order $\\chi$ for time-"
"evolution operator over $k$ Trotter steps is:\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana $\\chi$ ialah peringkat PF simetri dan $s_p = \\left( 4 - "
"4^{1/(2p-1)} \\right)^{-1}$. Untuk evolusi masa yang panjang, kita boleh "
"membahagikan selang masa $t$ kepada $k$ selang, dipanggil langkah Trotter, "
"berdurasi $t/k$ dan menghampiri evolusi masa dalam setiap selang dengan "
"formula produk peringkat $\\chi$, iaitu $S_{\\chi}$. Oleh itu, PF peringkat "
"$\\chi$ untuk pengoperasi evolusi masa merentasi $k$ langkah Trotter "
"ialah:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$ S_{\\chi}^{k}(t) = \\left[ S_{\\chi} \\left( \\frac{t}{k} "
"\\right)\\right]^k = e^{-i H t}+O\\left(t \\left( \\frac{t}{k} "
"\\right)^{\\chi} \\right)$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$ S_{\\chi}^{k}(t) = \\left[ S_{\\chi} \\left( \\frac{t}{k} "
"\\right)\\right]^k = e^{-i H t}+O\\left(t \\left( \\frac{t}{k} "
"\\right)^{\\chi} \\right)$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the error term decreases with the number of Trotter steps $k$ and the "
"order $\\chi$ of the PF.\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana sebutan ralat berkurang dengan bilangan langkah Trotter $k$ dan "
"peringkat $\\chi$ bagi PF.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Given an integer $k \\geq 1$ and a product formula $S_{\\chi}(t)$, the "
"approximate time-evolved state $\\rho_k(t)$ can be obtained from $\\rho_0$ "
"by applying $k$ iterations of the product formula "
"$S_{\\chi}\\left(\\frac{t}{k}\\right)$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Diberi integer $k \\geq 1$ dan formula produk $S_{\\chi}(t)$, keadaan yang "
"dievolusi masa secara hampiran $\\rho_k(t)$ boleh diperoleh daripada "
"$\\rho_0$ dengan menerapkan $k$ lelaran formula produk "
"$S_{\\chi}\\left(\\frac{t}{k}\\right)$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\rho_k(t)=S_{\\chi}\\left(\\frac{t}{k}\\right)^k \\rho_0 S_{\\chi}\\left(\\frac{t}{k}\\right)^{-k}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\rho_k(t)=S_{\\chi}\\left(\\frac{t}{k}\\right)^k \\rho_0 S_{\\chi}\\left(\\frac{t}{k}\\right)^{-k}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$\\rho_k(t)$ is an approximation for $\\rho(t)$ with the Trotter "
"approximation error ||$\\rho_k(t)-\\rho(t) ||$. If we consider a linear "
"combination of Trotter approximations of $\\rho(t)$:\n"
msgstr ""
"$\\rho_k(t)$ ialah hampiran bagi $\\rho(t)$ dengan ralat hampiran Trotter "
"||$\\rho_k(t)-\\rho(t) ||$. Jika kita mempertimbangkan gabungan linear bagi "
"hampiran Trotter untuk $\\rho(t)$:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mu(t) = \\sum_{j}^{l} x_j \\rho^{k_j}_{j}\\left(\\frac{t}{k_j}\\right) + \\text{some remaining Trotter error} \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mu(t) = \\sum_{j}^{l} x_j \\rho^{k_j}_{j}\\left(\\frac{t}{k_j}\\right) + \\text{beberapa ralat Trotter yang tinggal} \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $x_j$ are our weighting coefficients, $\\rho^{k_j}_j$ is the density matrix corresponding to the pure state obtained by evolving the initial state with the product formula, $S^{k_j}_{\\chi}$, involving $k_j$ Trotter steps, and $j \\in {1, ..., l}$ indexes the number of PFs that make up the MPF. All the terms in $\\mu(t)$ use the same product formula $S_{\\chi}(t)$ as its base.\n"
"The goal is to improve upon ||$\\rho_k(t)-\\rho(t) \\|$ by finding $\\mu(t)$ with even lower $\\|\\mu(t)-\\rho(t)\\|$.\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana $x_j$ ialah pekali pemberat kita, $\\rho^{k_j}_j$ ialah matriks ketumpatan yang sepadan dengan keadaan tulen yang diperoleh dengan mengevolusi keadaan awal menggunakan formula produk, $S^{k_j}_{\\chi}$, yang melibatkan $k_j$ langkah Trotter, dan $j \\in {1, ..., l}$ mengindeks bilangan PF yang membentuk MPF. Semua sebutan dalam $\\mu(t)$ menggunakan formula produk yang sama $S_{\\chi}(t)$ sebagai asasnya.\n"
"Matlamatnya adalah untuk mengatasi ||$\\rho_k(t)-\\rho(t) \\|$ dengan mencari $\\mu(t)$ yang mempunyai $\\|\\mu(t)-\\rho(t)\\|$ yang lebih rendah lagi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$\\mu(t)$ needs not be a physical state as $x_i$ need not be positive. The "
"goal here is to minimize the error in the expectation value of the "
"observables and not to find a physical replacement for $\\rho(t)$.\n"
msgstr ""
"$\\mu(t)$ tidak semestinya keadaan fizikal kerana $x_i$ tidak semestinya "
"positif. Matlamat di sini adalah untuk meminimumkan ralat dalam nilai "
"jangkaan observable dan bukan untuk mencari pengganti fizikal bagi "
"$\\rho(t)$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$k_j$ determines both the circuit depth and level of Trotter approximation. "
"Smaller values of $k_j$ lead to shorter circuits, which incur fewer circuit "
"errors but will be a less accurate approximation to the desired state.\n"
msgstr ""
"$k_j$ menentukan kedua-dua kedalaman Circuit dan tahap hampiran Trotter. "
"Nilai $k_j$ yang lebih kecil menghasilkan Circuit yang lebih pendek, yang "
"menanggung lebih sedikit ralat Circuit tetapi akan menjadi hampiran yang "
"kurang tepat bagi keadaan yang dikehendaki.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The key here is that the remaining Trotter error given by $\\mu(t)$ is "
"smaller than the Trotter error that one would obtain by simply using the "
"largest $k_j$ value.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perkara utama di sini ialah ralat Trotter yang tinggal yang diberikan oleh "
"$\\mu(t)$ adalah lebih kecil daripada ralat Trotter yang akan diperoleh "
"dengan hanya menggunakan nilai $k_j$ terbesar.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can view the usefulness of this from two perspectives:\n"
msgstr "Kamu boleh melihat kegunaan ini dari dua perspektif:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For a fixed budget of Trotter steps that you can execute, you can obtain "
"results with a Trotter error that is smaller in total.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk bajet langkah Trotter yang tetap yang boleh kamu jalankan, kamu boleh "
"mendapatkan keputusan dengan ralat Trotter yang lebih kecil secara "
"keseluruhan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Given some target number of Trotter steps that is too large to execute, you "
"can use the MPF to find a collection of lower-depth circuits to run that "
"results in a similar Trotter error.\n"
msgstr ""
"Diberi beberapa sasaran bilangan langkah Trotter yang terlalu besar untuk "
"dijalankan, kamu boleh menggunakan MPF untuk mencari koleksi Circuit "
"berkedalaman rendah untuk dijalankan yang menghasilkan ralat Trotter yang "
"serupa.\n"

