# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-"
"problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 2: Optimumkan masalah untuk pelaksanaan perkakasan kuantum "
"{#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's return to the calculation of the expectation value for a single time "
"point. We'll pick a backend for executing the experiment on hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mari kita kembali kepada pengiraan nilai jangkaan untuk satu titik masa. "
"Kita akan pilih satu Backend untuk menjalankan eksperimen pada perkakasan "
"sebenar.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then we remove outlier qubits from the coupling map to ensure that the "
"layout stage of the transpiler doesn't include them. Below we use the "
"reported backend properties stored in the `target` object and remove qubits "
"that either have measurement error or a two-qubit gate above a certain "
"threshold (`max_meas_err`, `max_twoq_err`) or $T_2$ time (which determines "
"the loss of coherence) below a certain threshold (`min_t2`).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kemudian kita buang qubit terpencil dari peta gandingan supaya peringkat "
"tataletak dalam Transpiler tidak memasukkan mereka. Di bawah kita gunakan "
"sifat Backend yang dilaporkan yang tersimpan dalam objek `target` dan buang "
"qubit yang mempunyai ralat pengukuran atau gate dua-Qubit melebihi ambang "
"tertentu (`max_meas_err`, `max_twoq_err`) atau masa $T_2$ (yang menentukan "
"kehilangan keherensi) di bawah ambang tertentu (`min_t2`).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We want to set `max_meas_err`,  `min_t2`, and `max_twoq_err` such that we "
"find a large enough subset of qubits that supports the circuit to run. In "
"our case it's enough to find a 10-qubit 1D chain.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita perlu tetapkan `max_meas_err`, `min_t2`, dan `max_twoq_err` supaya kita"
" jumpa subset qubit yang cukup besar untuk menyokong Circuit yang hendak "
"dijalankan. Dalam kes kita, cukup sekadar mencari rantaian 1D 10 qubit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/multi-product-"
"formula/extracted-outputs/c5d8e90b-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/multi-product-"
