"[\\[3\\]](#references).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-"
"inputs-to-a-quantum-problem-1}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 1: Petakan input klasik kepada masalah kuantum {#step-1-map-"
"classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem-1}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Hamiltonian {#hamiltonian}"
msgstr "Hamiltonian {#hamiltonian}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For the large-scale example, we use the XXZ model on a line of 50 sites:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk contoh berskala besar, kita guna model XXZ pada barisan 50 tapak:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{\\mathcal{H}}_{XXZ} = \\sum_{i=1}^{L-1} J_{i,(i+1)}\\left(X_i X_{(i+1)}+Y_i Y_{(i+1)}+ 2\\cdot Z_i Z_{(i+1)} \\right) \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{\\mathcal{H}}_{XXZ} = \\sum_{i=1}^{L-1} J_{i,(i+1)}\\left(X_i X_{(i+1)}+Y_i Y_{(i+1)}+ 2\\cdot Z_i Z_{(i+1)} \\right) \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $J_{i,(i+1)}$ is a random coefficient corresponding to edge $(i, "
"i+1)$. This is the Hamiltonian considered in the demonstration presented in "
"Ref. [\\[3\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana $J_{i,(i+1)}$ ialah pekali rawak yang sepadan dengan tepi $(i, "
"i+1)$. Ini adalah Hamiltonian yang dipertimbangkan dalam demonstrasi yang "
"ditunjukkan dalam Rujukan [\\[3\\]](#references).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/multi-product-"
"formula/extracted-outputs/34bf68ac-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/multi-product-"
"formula/extracted-outputs/34bf68ac-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For an observable we choose $Z_{24}Z_{25}$, as seen in the lower panel Fig. "
"5 of Ref. [\\[3\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk pemboleh ukur, kita pilih $Z_{24}Z_{25}$, seperti yang dapat dilihat "
"dalam panel bawah Rajah 5 dalam Rujukan [\\[3\\]](#references).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Choose Trotter steps {#choose-trotter-steps}"
msgstr "Pilih langkah Trotter {#choose-trotter-steps}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The experiment showcased in Fig. 4 of Ref. [\\[3\\]](#references) uses $k_j "
"= [2, 3, 4]$ symmetric Trotter steps of order $2$. We focus on the results "
"for time $t=3$, where the MPF and a PF with a higher number of Trotter steps"
" (6 in this case) have the same Trotter error. However, the MPF expectation "
"value is calculated from circuits corresponding to the lower number of "
"Trotter steps and thus shallower. In practice, even if the MPF and the "
"deeper Trotter steps circuit have the same Trotter error, we expect the "
"experimental expectation value calculated from the MPF circuits to be closer"
" to the theory one, as it entails running shallower circuits less exposed to"
" hardware noise compared to the circuit corresponding to the higher Trotter "
"step PF.\n"
msgstr ""
"Eksperimen yang ditunjukkan dalam Rajah 4 Rujukan [\\[3\\]](#references) "
"menggunakan $k_j = [2, 3, 4]$ langkah Trotter simetri peringkat $2$. Kita "
"fokus pada keputusan untuk masa $t=3$, di mana MPF dan PF dengan lebih "
"banyak langkah Trotter (6 dalam kes ini) mempunyai ralat Trotter yang sama. "
"Namun, nilai jangkaan MPF dikira daripada Circuit yang sepadan dengan "
"bilangan langkah Trotter yang lebih rendah dan oleh itu lebih cetek. Dalam "
"praktik, walaupun MPF dan Circuit langkah Trotter yang lebih dalam mempunyai"
" ralat Trotter yang sama, kita jangkakan nilai jangkaan eksperimen yang "
"dikira daripada Circuit MPF akan lebih hampir dengan nilai teori, kerana ia "
"melibatkan pelaksanaan Circuit yang lebih cetek dan kurang terdedah kepada "
"hingar perkakasan berbanding Circuit PF langkah Trotter yang lebih tinggi.\n"

